  "title": "Hey Harry, F'Crying Out Loud-- It is a Wonderful Life ... Sorta",
  "broadcast_date": "1991-02-27",
  "season": 8,
  "episode": 18,
  "plot_source_plaintext": "In this homage to It's A Wonderful Life, Harry is still depressed over his girlfriend, Margaret, leaving him. After angrily snapping at his friends and lamenting over taking his night court judge job, a guardian angel who looks like Mel Tormé visits Harry to show him what life would be like if he never took the job, which includes Dan becoming a corrupt judge, Mac becoming a bitterly-divorced district attorney, Christine losing her optimism and falling for Judge Dan, Roz being put in jail for protesting against the poor conditions of Dan's apartments, and Bull being elected deputy mayor and set up to be framed for Dan's crimes.",
